   "subject": "shinyMCE Now Available",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>I am excited to announce that shinyMCE - an implementation of the <a href=\"http://www.tinymce.com/tryit/basic.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.tinymce.com/tryit/basic.php&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403588767000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08kkzvjDf-DATC4X1Z75Fg\">tinyMCE</a> editor as a Shiny component - is now available for public use.</div><div><br></div><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:23.18181800842285px\">The shinyMCE source code is hosted at the </span><a href=\"https://github.com/mul118/shinyMCE\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);line-height:23.18181800842285px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/mul118/shinyMCE&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403588767000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ekOsMTaesIIXLX3s4mXIi\">shinyMCE Github repo</a><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:23.18181800842285px\">. More details and examples may be found at the </span><a href=\"http://mul118.github.io/shinyMCE/\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);line-height:23.18181800842285px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mul118.github.io/shinyMCE/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403588767000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fMBLN5y6ZM8-2xr1OfWE0\">shinyMCE website</a><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:23.18181800842285px\">.  In particular, you can check out the following <a href=\"https://iheart.shinyapps.io/shinyMCE-01-basic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://iheart.shinyapps.io/shinyMCE-01-basic/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403588767000&amp;usg=AOvVaw060P1Ehx3n43DA9RggGUbq\">live demo</a> to see shinyMCE in action.</span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:23.18181800842285px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:23.18181800842285px\">Let me know what you think! Feedback greatly appreciated</span></font></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
